	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ad tuas, venerande domine compater, copiosius <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>rescribam, maxime ad singula capita, quam nunc possim pr<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>opter maxima negotia et magnas incommoditates.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Venit ad me charissimus frater <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>, cuius adventu <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>supra quam dici possit exhilaratus sum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Interrogavit, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quid modo ipsi, ut faceret, consulerem, <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> ne <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ipsi mecum concedendum putem necne.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Mihi in prae<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sentiarum hoc visum est: non commodum esse, ut me<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>cum <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> proficiscatur, partim quia non recta illuc <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>revertar, sed <placeName ref="l582">Zofingae</placeName> et <placeName>Thunii</placeName> prius in examinando <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>moram traham, ut intra octiduum adhuc vix <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>redire possim, partim ne quidam alias nimirum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>suspicaces suspicentur nescio quid technarum subesse, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quasi illum ita intrudere velim.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hoc mihi videtur <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>modo consultissimum esse, ut <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> concedat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Meas illi promisi ad tempus aliquod aedes, donec <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vel ipsi prospiciatur vel ego redeam; nam omnino <placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>manere nolo.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> si vel per unum et alterum tantum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>habitaverit mensem, melius iudicabunt et sentient <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>de eo omnes; vestra enim cohabitatio et commendatio omnem ei <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>conciliabunt etiam apud asperiores authoritatem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Proximis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>diebus lectio theologica <persName ref="p3700">Eberhardo</persName> nostro addicta est <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>illeque e pulveribus hac ratione liberatus; non potuimus aliter agere <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>multis de rationibus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Interim ego laborabo et nihil <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>intermittam, quod pro <persName ref="p8417">Musculo</persName> futurum putem.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">post <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>2 fortassis menses veniam ipse <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Curabo apud <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nostrates, ut vel eum cum ipsorum consilio et praescientia <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tunc mecum adducere possim; interim hic haereat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Scribet uxori, ut cum liberis veniat.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Si <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>finito dimidii anni termino <placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> intelle<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>xerint me non mansurum, finito anno cogitabunt <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>diligentius de vocandis viris doctis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>By dem <persName>Caspar Sigrist</persName> finnt er schlüßel zuͦ dem hus; <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>da wil er selbs einen machen lan, das denocht <persName>Caspar <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Sigerist</persName> den sinen behalte von der källeren und korn<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>kameren wägen.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Die groß kamer by der stuben <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>und die uff dem holtzhus, auch die lang uff der sumer<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>lauben han ich imm gen, damitt er sich wol bhelffen <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>mag.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">So die <placeName>Buchteri</placeName> iren win uß dem großen <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>keller hetti, möcht ich wol lyden, das imm derselb auch <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>zuͦ sinem bruch ingeben wurde.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Reliqua referet <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ipse et frater meus; nam nunc plura non possum; <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>ubi venero, ipse disponam omnia diligentius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Nun <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>vale.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quod scribis de <persName>Apiario</persName>, curabo fidelissime.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Dominus Iesus te tuamque familiam aeternum custodiat.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/>Ex coenobio <placeName ref="l269">Küngsfeldensi</placeName> 10. Septembris <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z50"/>Tuus perpetuo <persName ref="p8018">Io<lb xml:id="p1z51"/>annes Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino suo ac patri <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>perpetuo colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
